# Wave W17-W (Mt. Apex — Central): spine flags — grand gallery flags with cruciform joint drawing: cool deep-grey flags whose joints meet in a cross at the tile’s heart, the cruciform gallery of the design drawn into every flag (design: a grand cruciform gallery joining the south door, Route 211’s west door and the great dressed stair). Mt. Apex — Central’s own floor — split from South’s step flags by temperature and the cross (level gallery vs climbing hall) and from North’s zenith flags by value entire: the spine is the mountain’s deep cool middle, the north floor its bright top.
